			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1759766395746,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Why can't we use Backend in Frotned ?\n- Security because browsers do not allow to use many underlying things \n- Call external apis cannot be called in browsers without proper cors headers \n- Databses cannot be used in browsers since we do not have drivers to handle binary data.\nsocket connections \nand many other things which can be one easily in a backend server.  \n- Frontend apps are used in many devices which have do not large computing power where\nbackend usually is where computation power is huge",
			"fontSize": 10.443543671014067,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Why can't we use Backend in Frotned ?\n- Security because browsers do not allow to use many underlying things \n- Call external apis cannot be called in browsers without proper cors headers \n- Databses cannot be used in browsers since we do not have drivers to handle binary data.\nsocket connections \nand many other things which can be one easily in a backend server.  \n- Frontend apps are used in many devices which have do not large computing power where\nbackend usually is where computation power is huge",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
