			],
			"updated": 1759766395746,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1. Allows to us quickly understand a project/codebase just by looking at it.\n2.  Faster on boarding because syntax may change but the core principles don't.\n3. Can move faster with new projects\n4. Syntax fatigue is not there and since you undertsand the core principles you\njust need to get a little bit syntax and then using patterns you can comfortably\nstart working with the new language for backend.\n5. Chosing the best tool for the right job instead of using same language or\nframework everywhere.\n  ",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "1. Allows to us quickly understand a project/codebase just by looking at it.\n2.  Faster on boarding because syntax may change but the core principles don't.\n3. Can move faster with new projects\n4. Syntax fatigue is not there and since you undertsand the core principles you\njust need to get a little bit syntax and then using patterns you can comfortably\nstart working with the new language for backend.\n5. Chosing the best tool for the right job instead of using same language or\nframework everywhere.\n  ",
