		{
			"id": "xPN1OeFe",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -702.0123414807,
			"y": -247.93973279082257,
			"width": 997.9656214278654,
			"height": 199.5212086444764,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#ffd43b",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"1mh74pO9YpmpMypQo0AjZ"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b8yl",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 667140108,
			"version": 2215,
			"versionNonce": 1162855127,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1759771507762,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1. Stateless : \nIt has no info about past interactions with server and has all necessary details with it when it \nvisits server once server responds it forgets about the request.\n\nAdvantages:\n- Server does not need to manage state and remember anything, it gets everything it needs on \nruntime. \n- Enables distribution of request accross mutliple servers since no single server needs to keep track \nof request and state it carries about client interactions, neither crashing of one server affects client interactions becuase there is not session\nmanagement on server side\n- Becuase there is no state client side uses tokens, cookies and sessions to maintain continuity in certain client side actions like logins, carts history\netc.",
			"fontSize": 13.30141390963176,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "1. Stateless : \nIt has no info about past interactions with server and has all necessary details with it when it \nvisits server once server responds it forgets about the request.\n\nAdvantages:\n- Server does not need to manage state and remember anything, it gets everything it needs on \nruntime. \n- Enables distribution of request accross mutliple servers since no single server needs to keep track \nof request and state it carries about client interactions, neither crashing of one server affects client interactions becuase there is not session\nmanagement on server side\n- Becuase there is no state client side uses tokens, cookies and sessions to maintain continuity in certain client side actions like logins, carts history\netc.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
