			"text": "- Http headers are extensible ,\nmeans adding only some Metadata\nvan have huge effect on what is\nand will be sent back ny server and\nhow its security will be managed,\nsimilarly we can easily add any new\nheader custom one using X-custom\nheader for our own uses .",
